# ============================================================
# Raw dataset
# Historical DDTI JPG/XML objects ARE already tracked in Git history.
# These ignore patterns do not remove tracked content or authorize redistribution.
# See Research_Extension/DATA_RELEASE_PERMISSION_DECISION.md.
# ============================================================
02_Dataset_Raw/*
!02_Dataset_Raw/README.md
!02_Dataset_Raw/.gitkeep

